  "prefLabel": "Rev 2902.10 Taxpayer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2902.10 “Taxpayer” means any person, entity, or association subject to any provision of the tax and revenue rules and laws of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #10388, eff 7-25-13 (from Rev 2902.08), renumbered by #10885 (from Rev 2902.09); ss by #13660, eff 6-21-23",
